N00B_DIAG(EXTENT_COUNT_TYPE, "N00B-T1038", ERROR,
    "the `count` field of an extent clause is not an integer",
    "The field named by `count` holds the number of elements, so it must\n"
    "have an integer type.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_PARAMETER_FIXED, "N00B-T1039", ERROR,
    "a function body fixes a declared type parameter to one type",
    "A declared type parameter must work for any type. Use the concrete\n"
    "type instead of the parameter, or make the body generic.")
N00B_DIAG(NIL_CONSTANT, "N00B-T1040", ERROR,
    "a `const` would hold `nil`",
    "A `const` holds a value of an ordinary type; `nil` on its own is not\n"
    "one.")
N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_JUMP_LABEL, "N00B-N1002", ERROR,
    "`break` or `continue` names a label that does not enclose it",
    "The label must belong to an enclosing loop, or for `break`, an\n"
    "enclosing `switch` or `typecase`.")
